---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---

<Page title="Beyond Tech" description="When I'm not building cloud platforms, I perform comedy magic.">

  <div class="section-header">
    <span class="section-header__eyebrow">Personal</span>
    <h1>Beyond Tech</h1>
  </div>

  <hr class="divider" />

  <section class="beyond">
    <p class="beyond__text">
      When I'm not architecting cloud platforms or contributing to open source, I perform comedy magic. It started as a hobby and turned into something much bigger — I've performed for the embassies of Denmark, Germany, and Yemen, toured a travelling theatre show called <em>K(night) of Awkwardness</em>, and been featured on News18 India live.
    </p>
    <p class="beyond__text">
      It's a completely different world from Kubernetes and GitOps, but the overlap is real: both require reading the room, understanding systems, and delivering something nobody expected.
    </p>
    <p class="beyond__text">
      For my magic work, show details, and booking inquiries, visit:
    </p>
    <a href="https://whitecrowmagic.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="beyond__link">
      whitecrowmagic.com &rarr;
    </a>
  </section>

</Page>

<style>
  .beyond {
    max-width: 60ch;
  }

  .beyond__text {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .beyond__link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-accent);
    transition: color 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .beyond__link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent-hover);
    border-color: var(--color-accent-hover);
  }
</style>
